msgstr "新名称（可选）"
msgid "Read every Task's control flow -- its If/Else/End If, For/End For, Goto and Stop -- and report what does not hold together: a block that is never closed, a Goto aimed at a label no action carries, and actions nothing can ever reach.\n\nWith a single Task chosen in the 'Specific Name' tab, that Task is also drawn as a flowchart in its own window, with an arrow from every Goto to the action it lands on.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the current directory."
msgstr "读取每个任务的控制流 - 它的 If/Else/End If、For/End For、Goto 和 Stop - 并报告不连贯的内容：永远不会关闭的块、针对没有操作携带的标签的 Goto 以及任何操作都无法到达的操作。\n\n在“具体名称”选项卡中选择单个任务后，该任务也会在其自己的窗口中绘制为流程图，并带有从每个转到到其所在操作的箭头。\n\n结果显示在此处并保存到当前目录中的文本文件中。"
msgid "Refactor"
msgstr "重构"
msgid "Refactor preview could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存重构预览。"
msgid "Refactor preview saved as"
msgstr "重构预览另存为"
