msgid "A Profile keeping a radio or sensor awake."
msgstr "让无线电或传感器保持唤醒的配置文件。"
msgid "A Profile firing on a very short timer."
msgstr "按极短计时器触发的配置文件。"
msgid "A Task looping around a short Wait."
msgstr "围绕短暂 'Wait' 循环的任务。"
msgid "A long-running Task left on the default collision handling."
msgstr "仍使用默认冲突处理的长时间运行任务。"
msgid "An action that can block for ever."
msgstr "可能永久阻塞的操作。"
msgid "An API key or access token."
msgstr "API 密钥或访问令牌。"
msgid "A bearer token in an Authorization header."
msgstr "Authorization 标头中的 bearer 令牌。"
msgid "A password written into a value."
msgstr "写入某个值中的密码。"
msgid "A private key, in full."
msgstr "完整的私钥。"
msgid "A field Tasker itself calls Password or Username, filled in."
msgstr "Tasker 自身称为 Password 或 Username 且已填写的字段。"
msgid "An email address."
msgstr "电子邮件地址。"
msgid "A telephone number."
msgstr "电话号码。"
msgid "Coordinates precise enough to be an address."
msgstr "精确到足以定位地址的坐标。"
msgid "Check IDs"
msgstr "核对身份证明"
msgid "Has the device make a fresh backup before anything is sent, and compares its IDs with the ones being sent.\n\nIt reports an ID Tasker has already given to a different Project, Profile or Task, and an object Tasker has under a different ID.  Tasker can leave an object out of an import when its ID is already taken -- and IDs for anything added here come from the loaded backup, which the device may have moved past.\n\nIt takes a few seconds, and installs a small 'MapTasker Backup For ID Check' Task on the device the first time.  The backup is read into memory and deleted from the device; it is not saved on this computer."
msgstr "设备在发送任何内容之前，是否进行了新的备份，并与正在发送的 ID 进行比较。\n\n它会报告 Tasker 已经将某个 ID 分配给另一个项目、配置文件或任务，以及 Tasker 在另一个 ID 下的对象。当 ID 已经被占用时，Tasker 可以从导入中排除该对象。而在此处添加的对象的 ID 来自加载的备份，该备份可能已经被设备移动。\n\n这个过程需要几秒钟，并且首次安装在设备上一个名为“MapTasker 备份用于 ID 检查”的任务。备份内容会加载到内存中，然后从设备中删除。这不会保存到这个电脑上。"
msgid "'Export' saves what this view shows to a file in the current directory:\n\nMarkdown, for a wiki page, an issue or a note.\nJSON, for a script to read.\nPDF, for printing or sending, with searchable text and bookmarks.\n\n"
msgstr "“导出”功能会将当前视图的内容保存到当前目录中的一个文件中：\n\n*   Markdown：用于创建维基页面、问题或笔记。\n*   JSON：用于脚本读取。\n*   PDF：用于打印或发送，包含可搜索的文本和书签。\n\n"
msgid "Ask AI"
msgstr "向人工智能提问"
msgid "Ask in plain words"
msgstr "用简单的语言提问"
msgid "Export"
msgstr "出口"
msgid "Exported"
msgstr "出口"
msgid "Exported to"
msgstr "出口到"
msgid "Generator"
msgstr "发电机"
msgid "Left out, as each box holds one value"
msgstr "每个盒子只包含一个值，因此会遗漏其他值。"
msgid "Left out, as this configuration does not use it"
msgstr "由于这种配置未使用它。"
msgid "MapTasker Diagram"
msgstr "MapTasker 图表"
msgid "MapTasker Map"
msgstr "MapTasker 地图"
msgid "No password store was available, so the API keys were saved to a file only you can read:"
msgstr "由于没有密码存储功能，因此 API 密钥仅保存在您能够访问的文件中："
msgid "Not expressible as a search"
msgstr "无法用搜索来表达"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"
msgid "The API keys could not be saved:"
msgstr "API 密钥无法保存："
msgid "The export could not be saved:"
msgstr "无法保存导出："
msgid "The question could not be turned into a search.  Try naming an action, a trigger, an app or a Scene."
msgstr "这个问题无法转化为搜索条件。请尝试使用动作、触发器、应用程序或场景来指定。"
msgid "The question to the AI model was cancelled."
msgstr "向人工智能模型提出的问题已被取消。"
msgid "Type a question first."
msgstr "首先输入您的问题。"
msgid "e.g. every Profile that fires on wifi at home"
msgstr "例如，所有在家庭 Wi-Fi 上启动的个人资料。"
msgid "%par1 (optional)"
msgstr "%par1 (可选)"
msgid "%par2 (optional)"
msgstr "%par2 (可选)"
msgid "Delete These Helper Tasks First"
msgstr "首先删除这些辅助任务。"
msgid "Delete them from Tasker's Tasks tab -- long-press one, then Delete.  Nothing here can do it: Tasker's HTTP API has no way to delete a Task.  To make the next cleanup a single delete, put the helper Tasks in the 'MapTasker' Project from the Android panel."
msgstr "从 Tasker 的“任务”选项卡中删除它们：长按一个任务，然后删除。 这里的任何操作都无法实现：Tasker 的 HTTP API 无法删除任务。 为了使下一次清理操作成为一次删除，请将辅助任务放在 Android 面板中的“MapTasker”项目下。"
msgid "Delete them in Tasker -- or delete the 'MapTasker' Project, if they are already in it -- and then try again."
msgstr "在 Tasker 中删除它们 -- 或者，如果它们已经存在于“MapTasker”项目中，则删除该项目，然后重新尝试。"
msgid "Enter the Android device's IP Address and Port."
msgstr "输入 Android 设备的 IP 地址和端口。"
msgid "Put Helper Tasks in 'MapTasker' Project"
msgstr "将辅助任务放在“MapTasker”项目中"
msgid "Puts every helper Task this version of MapTasker uses into one Project file, 'MapTasker.prj.xml', in /Tasker/projects on the device.  Import it in Tasker: long-press the Projects tab bar and choose Import Project.\n\nOnce they are in that Project, deleting the 'MapTasker' Project in Tasker removes all of them at once.  MapTasker puts back any it needs the next time it is used.\n\nTasker refuses the whole Project if it already has any of these Tasks, so any helper Tasks already on the device are listed first for you to delete manu."
msgstr "将此版本的 MapTasker 中所有任务都放在一个“MapTasker.prj.xml”项目文件中，该文件位于设备上的 /Tasker/projects 目录下。 在 Tasker 中导入该文件：长按“项目”选项卡，然后选择“导入项目”。\n\n一旦这些任务都位于该项目文件中，在 Tasker 中删除“MapTasker”项目，可以一次性删除所有任务。 当 MapTasker 再次使用时，它会自动恢复需要使用的任务。\n\n如果 Tasker 已经存在这些任务，它会拒绝整个项目。 因此，您可以在 Tasker 中手动删除设备上已存在的任何任务。"
msgid "Return value:"
msgstr "返回值："
msgid "Run On Android"
msgstr "在 Android 上运行"
msgid "Run Task On Android"
msgstr "在 Android 上运行任务"
msgid "Run the selected Task on your Android device and see what it returned."
msgstr "在您的 Android 设备上运行选定的任务，并查看其结果。"
msgid "Running on the Android device -- accept the authorization prompt there if one appears."
msgstr "在 Android 设备上运行 – 如果出现授权提示，请在设备上接受。"
msgid "Running..."
msgstr "跑步..."
msgid "Runs the Task as Tasker on the Android device has it now, waits for it to finish, and shows what it returned.  Edits not yet sent with 'Save To Android' are not part of the run.  Tasker must be running, with the 'HTTP Server Example' project active."
msgstr "目前，该任务通过 Android 上的 Tasker 运行，等待其完成，并显示其返回的结果。 使用“保存到 Android”功能编辑的任务，尚未包含在本次运行中。 Tasker 必须正在运行，并且“HTTP Server Example”项目处于活动状态。"
msgid "Runs this Task on your Android device and shows what it returned, or the error.\n\nThe device runs the Task as Tasker already has it: use 'Save To Android' first to run your edits."
msgstr "在您的 Android 设备上运行此任务，并显示其返回的结果或错误。\n\n设备将以 Tasker 预先配置的方式运行此任务：首先使用“保存到 Android”功能进行编辑。"
msgid "Task finished in"
msgstr "任务已完成"
msgid "Tasker refuses to import a Project that contains a Task it already has, so the 'MapTasker' Project cannot be imported while these are in Tasker:"
msgstr "Tasker 拒绝导入包含一个已存在的任务的项目，因此“MapTasker”项目无法在 Tasker 中导入，除非这些任务已经存在于 Tasker 中。"
msgid "The Task could not be run."
msgstr "任务无法执行。"
msgid "The Task did not return a value."
msgstr "该任务没有返回任何值。"
msgid "The Task really runs: anything it does on the device -- messages, settings, files -- happens for real."
msgstr "“Task” 实际上是完全可执行的：它对设备上的一切（包括消息、设置和文件）所做的操作，都会真正生效。"
msgid "This Task has unsaved edits.  The device runs the version it already has -- use 'Save To Android' first to run the edited one."
msgstr "此任务包含未保存的修改。 设备将运行它已有的版本——首先使用“保存到 Android”功能，以便运行修改后的版本。"
msgid "Watch your Android device: expect one or more prompts from Tasker reading 'Tasker API Authorize request from python-requests...'.  Accept each one, or the run fails."
msgstr "监控您的 Android 设备：您可能会收到 Tasker 提示，内容为“从 python-requests 接收 Tasker API 授权请求...”。请接受所有提示，否则程序将无法运行。"
msgid "Exit MapTasker and update it from the command line: 'pip install --upgrade maptasker'."
msgstr "退出 MapTasker 并从命令行更新：'pip install --upgrade maptasker'。"
msgid "The update failed and MapTasker is still on the version you were running."
msgstr "更新失败，MapTasker 仍然使用您之前使用的版本。"
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "旗帜"
msgid "Not visible until a Task shows it"
msgstr "只有在任务显示时才会显示"
msgid "Bring back a Task, Profile or Scene that has been deleted, or put one back as it was before it was edited -- from any configuration kept in the history that 'Changes Since...' reads.\n\nOne object at a time, never a merge: every restore is shown before anything happens, says what it leaves for you to do (a Profile to relink, say), and is one press of Undo afterwards."
msgstr "恢复已删除的任务、个人资料或场景，或者将它们恢复到之前的状态，具体操作取决于“自...以来更改”所显示的任何配置。\n\n每次只恢复一个对象，绝不合并：每次恢复都会显示，并告知您需要执行的操作（例如，重新关联一个个人资料），并且只需一个“撤销”操作即可。"
msgid "Cancel Preview"
msgstr "取消预览"
msgid "Cannot be repaired here"
msgstr "无法在这里进行维修"
msgid "Could not save to current file:"
msgstr "无法保存到当前文件："
msgid "Fix Findings"
msgstr "解决问题"
msgid "Fix preview could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存预览。"
msgid "Fix preview saved as"
msgstr "已保存的预览"
msgid "Newest first.  The newest is usually the file you have open, so it holds anything deleted or edited this session; for something that was gone before you loaded this file, choose an earlier one."
msgstr "最新的优先显示。 通常，最新的文件就是您当前打开的文件，因此它会保存您在此会话中删除或修改的内容。 如果您之前打开的文件已经消失，请选择一个较早的文件。"
msgid "No configuration history has been recorded yet -- every file you load is kept from now on."
msgstr "目前还没有记录任何配置历史。从现在开始，您上传的所有文件都会被保留。"
msgid "Nothing here can be repaired automatically."
msgstr "这里没有任何东西可以自动修复。"
msgid "Nothing in this configuration can be repaired from here.  Run the Health Check itself to see everything else it has to say."
msgstr "此配置中没有任何部件可以从这里进行维修。请自行运行“健康检查”程序，以查看它还有其他需要说明的内容。"
msgid "Press 'Restore this' on a row first."
msgstr "首先，点击“恢复此”按钮。"
msgid "Preview -- nothing has changed yet"
msgstr "预览 – 尚未有任何变化。"
msgid "Reading that configuration..."
msgstr "阅读这些配置..."
msgid "Repair the Health Check findings that have an obvious fix: set a long Task's collision handling, give a blocking action a timeout, close an 'If' that is never closed, point a broken 'Goto' at a label that exists, delete a Task nothing runs.\n\nEverything is shown before anything is done, you tick what you want, and the whole lot is one press of Undo afterwards.\n\nMost kinds of finding are not offered here -- a broken 'Perform Task' or a password written into an action is a decision only you can make."
msgstr "修复那些有明显解决方案的健康检查结果：设置长时间任务的碰撞处理，为阻塞操作设置超时时间，关闭从未关闭的“If”语句，将一个损坏的“Goto”指向存在的标签，删除一个没有任何运行的任务。\n\n所有内容在执行之前都会显示，您可以选择您想要的操作，然后通过一个“撤销”操作完成整个过程。\n\n这里提供的解决方案并不全面——例如，修复一个“执行任务”或将密码写入操作，只能由您自己决定。"
msgid "Restore From History"
msgstr "从历史中恢复"
msgid "Restore from the configuration as it was on"
msgstr "从配置恢复到之前的状态。"
msgid "Restore this"
msgstr "恢复"
msgid "Saved a copy to"
msgstr "保存副本至"
msgid "Scan Again"
msgstr "再次扫描"
msgid "Tick All"
msgstr "勾选所有"
msgid "Tick None"
msgstr "未选择"
msgid "Tick something first."
msgstr "先完成第一项任务。"
msgid "and loaded it.  The original file was left unchanged."
msgstr "并将文件加载。原始文件保持不变。"
msgid "but it could not be loaded:"
msgstr "但无法加载："
msgid "changed since, to put back"
msgstr "自从改变了，恢复"
msgid "deleted since, to bring back"
msgstr "已删除，因为..."
msgid "fix"
msgstr "修复"
msgid "more -- apply these, then scan again"
msgstr "更多 – 首先应用这些方法，然后再次扫描。"
msgid "more -- the preview lists them all"
msgstr "更多 – 预览功能会显示所有"
msgid "more problems -- see the log."
msgstr "更多问题 – 请查看日志。"
msgid "more.  Choose a more recent configuration."
msgstr "更多。选择一个更新的配置。"
msgid "not offered"
msgstr "未提供"
msgid "now"
msgstr "现在"
msgid "offered"
msgstr "提供"
msgid "repaired."
msgstr "已修复。"
msgid "ticked"
msgstr "已选中"
msgid "'Export' saves what this view shows to a file in the Output Folder:\n\nMarkdown, for a wiki page, an issue or a note.\nJSON, for a script to read.\nPDF, for printing or sending, with searchable text and bookmarks.\n\n"
msgstr "“导出”可以将此视图的内容保存到输出文件夹中的文件：\n\n*   Markdown：用于创建维基页面、问题或笔记。\n*   JSON：用于脚本读取。\n*   PDF：用于打印或发送，包含可搜索的文本和书签。\n\n"
msgid "- Output Folder: Reports (Health Check, Fix, Find, Compare and the rest), view exports and the Map/Diagram files are written to the 'Output Folder' set in the settings drawer.  Left empty, that is a 'MapTasker' folder in your Documents folder.  \n"
msgstr "- 输出文件夹：报告（包括健康检查、修复、查找、比较等），导出的文件以及地图/图表文件都保存在“输出文件夹”中，该文件夹在设置面板中进行设置。如果该文件夹为空，则会在您的“文档”文件夹中创建一个名为“MapTasker”的文件夹。\n"
msgid "Clear Log"
msgstr "清晰的日志"
msgid "Compare another XML file against the loaded one: what was added, removed, renamed and changed.\n\nUse it to see what a TaskerNet import brought in, what an edit changed, or what is different between two backups.\n\nIf the loaded file came from 'Save to Current File', the file it was saved from is offered directly.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the Output Folder."
msgstr "将另一个 XML 文件与已加载的文件进行比较：哪些内容被添加、删除、重命名或更改了。\n\n使用它来查看 TaskerNet 导入的内容、编辑修改的内容，或两个备份之间的差异。\n\n如果已加载的文件来自“保存到当前文件”，则可以直接查看该文件。\n\n结果会在此处显示，并保存到输出文件夹中的文本文件中。"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"
msgid "Display Log"
msgstr "显示日志"
msgid "Fetch the list of installed applications from your Android device, so the check for plugins that are not installed is up to date."
msgstr "从您的 Android 设备获取已安装应用程序的列表，以便检查未安装的插件是否已更新。"
msgid "Forget"
msgstr "忘记"
msgid "Forgot the applications fetched from"
msgstr "忘记了从...获取的应用程序"
msgid "Forgotten for now, but could not be saved:"
msgstr "暂时遗忘，但无法挽回："
msgid "No app list has been fetched from the device, so plugins cannot be checked for being installed."
msgstr "尚未从设备获取任何应用列表，因此无法检查插件是否已安装。"
msgid "No notifications have been logged."
msgstr "尚未记录任何通知。"
msgid "Notification Log"
msgstr "通知记录"
msgid "Notification log cleared."
msgstr "已清除通知记录。"
msgid "Output Folder"
msgstr "输出文件夹"
msgid "Output Folder:"
msgstr "输出文件夹："
msgid "Read every Task's control flow -- its If/Else/End If, For/End For, Goto and Stop -- and report what does not hold together: a block that is never closed, a Goto aimed at a label no action carries, and actions nothing can ever reach.\n\nWith a single Task chosen in the 'Specific Name' tab, that Task is also drawn as a flowchart in its own window, with an arrow from every Goto to the action it lands on.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the Output Folder."
msgstr "阅读每个任务的控制流程——包括 If/Else/End If、For/End For、Goto 和 Stop——，并报告哪些部分不完整：未关闭的区块、指向没有操作的标签的 Goto，以及无法执行的操作。\n\n在“特定名称”选项卡中选择一个任务后，该任务也会以流程图的形式显示在自己的窗口中，其中每个 Goto 都通过箭头连接到它指向的操作。\n\n结果会显示在此处，并保存到输出文件夹中的文本文件中。"
msgid "Refresh App List"
msgstr "刷新应用列表"
msgid "Remove this device's list of applications.  Do this for a device you no longer use, or an old address of this one, so apps that are not installed any more stop being offered and counted as installed."
msgstr "删除此设备的应用程序列表。 这样做适用于您不再使用的设备，或此设备的旧地址，以便不再安装的应用程序不再显示和被计算为已安装。"
msgid "Scan the loaded XML for broken references, unreferenced Tasks, Profiles and Scenes, naming problems, Task flow, variables, behaviour on the device, and secrets.\n\nYou choose which of those to report before it runs, and that choice is remembered.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the Output Folder."
msgstr "扫描加载的 XML 文件，查找是否存在以下问题：\n* 损坏的引用\n* 未引用的任务、个人资料和场景\n* 命名问题\n* 任务流程\n* 变量\n* 设备上的行为\n* 密钥\n\n您在运行之前选择要报告的问题，并且该选择会被记住。\n\n结果会在此处显示，并保存到输出文件夹中的文本文件中。"
msgid "The folder MapTasker writes its reports (Health Check, Fix, Find, Compare and the rest), view exports, the Map and Diagram files, and standalone exports to.\n\nLeave it empty to use a MapTasker folder in your Documents folder.  The folder is created if it does not exist."
msgstr "MapTasker 将其报告（健康检查、修复、查找、比较以及其他）、导出文件、地图和图表文件，以及独立的导出文件都保存在该文件夹中。\n\n如果需要使用 MapTasker 文件夹，请将其放在您的“文档”文件夹中。 如果该文件夹不存在，则会自动创建。"
msgid "Trace every %variable in the loaded XML: where each one is set, where it is read, which are read but never set, which are set but never read, and which near-identical names (%MyVar against %Myvar) are likely typos.\n\nSearched: Task actions and their conditions, plugin configuration, Profile contexts and Scenes.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the Output Folder."
msgstr "追踪加载的 XML 中每个变量：确定每个变量的设置位置、读取位置、哪些变量被读取但未设置、哪些变量被设置但未读取，以及哪些非常相似的名称（例如 %MyVar 与 %Myvar）很可能是拼写错误。\n\n搜索内容：任务操作及其条件、插件配置、用户配置文件和场景。\n\n结果会在此处显示，并保存到输出文件夹中的文本文件中。"
msgid "What has changed in your configuration since a moment you choose: today, this week, this month, everything kept, or a specific date.\n\nNo file to pick -- every configuration you load is kept, compressed, in a MapTasker_Timeline folder in the current directory, and the one from back then is compared against what you have open now.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the Output Folder."
msgstr "自从您选择某个时间点后，您的配置发生了哪些变化？例如：今天、本周、本月、保持原样，或特定日期。\n\n无需选择文件 – 您加载的每种配置都会被保存，并压缩在一个名为 MapTasker_Timeline 的文件夹中，该文件夹位于当前目录。然后，旧版本的配置会与您当前打开的版本进行比较。\n\n结果将在此处显示，并保存到输出文件夹中的文本文件中。"
msgid "(fires at a moment, then is done)"
msgstr "（突然开火，然后停止）"
msgid "(no app in front)"
msgstr "（没有应用程序）"
msgid "(not connected)"
msgstr "（未连接）"
msgid "(not simulated)"
msgstr "（非模拟）"
msgid "App in front"
msgstr "应用程序"
msgid "Battery %"
msgstr "电池百分比"
msgid "Choose a date and a time."
msgstr "选择一个日期和时间。"
msgid "Collisions"
msgstr "碰撞"
msgid "Date"
msgstr "日期"
msgid "Each Profile's entry Task, highest priority first.  'tied' starts share a priority, and Tasker does not fix the order among them."
msgstr "每个 Profile 的任务，按照优先级从高到低排列。当任务被标记为“待处理”时，它们将共享优先级，Tasker 不会改变它们之间的顺序。"
msgid "Leave empty to not simulate the battery level."
msgstr "如果留空，则不模拟电池电量。"
msgid "No Profile that is, or may be, active starts a Task."
