msgid "Dry-run one Task: pick it, say what its variables hold when it starts, and see which If, Else If, For and Goto branches it takes and what every variable holds after each action.\n\nActions that talk to the outside world are listed as 'not simulated', and a variable one of them may have set is treated as unknown rather than guessed.  Nothing is run on your phone and nothing in the configuration changes."
msgstr "**任务模拟：** 选择一个任务，观察其在启动时所包含的变量，并查看它会执行哪些“if”、“else if”、“for”和“goto”分支，以及每个分支执行后每个变量的值。\n\n与外部世界交互的任务，会标记为“未模拟”。 并且，如果其中一个任务中设置的变量的值未知，则将其视为未知，而不是猜测。 您的手机不会执行任何操作，并且配置中的任何更改都不会生效。"
msgid "Follow this file"
msgstr "请参考此文件"
msgid "Healthier"
msgstr "更健康"
msgid "Is your configuration getting healthier or messier?  Measures every configuration the history has kept -- Task length, nesting depth, how deep Perform Task calls go, and what the Health Check finds -- and shows each number over time, for the whole configuration and for each Project.\n\nEach configuration is measured once and the figures are kept, so only the first look is slow."
msgstr "您的配置是否变得更健康或更混乱？ 它会记录所有配置的历史数据，包括：任务长度、嵌套深度、`Perform Task` 函数的深度以及健康检查的结果，并显示这些数值随时间的变化，既显示整个配置，也显示每个项目的相关数据。\n\n每个配置只会被测量一次，并且数据会被保存，因此最初的查看过程可能会比较慢。"
msgid "List the variables this Task reads before it sets them, for you to fill in."
msgstr "在执行此任务之前，请您填写以下变量："
msgid "Longest walk (actions)"
msgstr "最长的步行（行动）"
msgid "Look at"
msgstr "请看"
msgid "Look for configurations kept since this was last measured."
msgstr "查找上次测量时所记录的配置。"
msgid "Map saved to"
msgstr "地图已保存至"
msgid "Measure Again"
msgstr "再次测量"
msgid "Measuring..."
msgstr "测量..."
msgid "Messier"
msgstr "美星"
msgid "Needs a value for"
msgstr "需要一个值"
msgid "Never reached"
msgstr "从未实现"
msgid "No XML file with Tasks has been loaded.  Get an XML file first."
msgstr "未找到包含“任务”的 XML 文件。请先获取一个 XML 文件。"
msgid "Not enough history: a trend needs at least two kept configurations."
msgstr "缺乏历史：任何一种趋势至少需要两种不同的配置才能有效。"
msgid "Not measured"
msgstr "未测量"
msgid "Other variables"
msgstr "其他变量"
msgid "Press Step first."
msgstr "首先按“打印”按钮。"
msgid "Since the one before"
msgstr "自从上次"
msgid "Starting variables (one per line:  %name = value)"
msgstr "初始变量（每行一个：%name = value）"
msgid "Step"
msgstr "步骤"
msgid "Suggest Inputs"
msgstr "建议输入"
msgid "Task Stepper"
msgstr "任务执行器"
msgid "That Task is not in the configuration that is loaded."
msgstr "该任务不在加载的配置中。"
msgid "The whole configuration"
msgstr "整个配置"
msgid "These lines could not be read"
msgstr "这些线无法辨认。"
msgid "This Task reads no variable before it sets it."
msgstr "这个任务在设置变量之前，不会读取该变量的值。"
msgid "Trend Dashboard"
msgstr "趋势仪表盘"
msgid "Use the globals saved in the backup"
msgstr "使用备份中保存的全局变量。"
msgid "Walk this Task in the Task Stepper."
msgstr "请在任务步骤中完成此任务。"
msgid "What an action that is not simulated leaves (one per line:  5: %name = value)"
msgstr "这是一种非模拟的操作，它会留下（每行一个）：%name = value"
msgid "When a condition depends on a variable with no value"
msgstr "当一个条件依赖于一个没有值的变量时。"
msgid "after action"
msgstr "行动后"
msgid "at the end"
msgstr "在最后"
msgid "configurations measured."
msgstr "已测量到的配置。"
msgid "longest Task"
msgstr "最长的任务"
msgid "more actions -- Copy As Text has them all"
msgstr "更多操作 -- “复制为文本” 功能包含了所有"
msgid "problems"
msgstr "问题"
msgid "- Refactor > Variable: Rename a variable everywhere it is used, or change it between global and local.  Tasker reads the scope from the spelling -- all lower case is local to the running Task, any capital makes it a global shared by everything -- so Make local and Make global change who can see the value, and the preview checks it first.  It reads the whole configuration whatever is selected above, and refuses (naming the place) when the new name is already a variable, when a Scene or a Profile's condition reads a global you are making local, or when a Task reads it before setting it.  Several Tasks that shared a global each get a copy of their own, and a local made global is shared by every Task: the preview says both.  Previewed before anything is done, and one press of Undo afterwards.  \n"
msgstr "- 重构 > 变量：在所有使用的地方重命名变量，或者在全局和局部之间进行更改。Tasker 会从变量名称中读取作用域——所有小写字母表示局部变量，而所有大写字母表示全局变量，所有变量都可以被使用；因此，\"Make local\" 和 \"Make global\" 更改了谁可以查看该变量的值，并且预览功能会首先进行检查。它会读取所有选定的配置，并在新名称已经是一个变量时拒绝（即，如果场景或用户配置文件中读取的是全局变量，则将其设为局部变量，或者如果任务在设置之前先读取它），多个共享全局变量的任务，都会获得自己的副本，而将局部变量设为全局变量，则会共享给所有任务：预览功能会同时显示。在执行任何操作之前进行预览，然后只需点击“撤销”即可。\n"
msgid "Save Preview writes them all"
msgstr "“Save Preview” 功能会将所有内容保存下来。"
msgid "What the variable is to be called.  Filled in for you when you make a variable local or global; type your own if you prefer.  A name already in use is refused."
msgstr "变量的名称。在您创建局部或全局变量时，会自动填写。如果您有其他要求，请自行填写。如果名称已在使用，则会被拒绝。"
msgid "new"
msgstr "新"
msgid "- Live Run Monitor: Watch which Profiles and Tasks fire on your Android device as they do.  Press Start and MapTasker puts a small helper Task on the device that looks at Tasker's own list of running Tasks and active Profiles several times a second and reports them back every few seconds; what became active, what started and what finished is logged (click a line to go to it), and with the Diagram open each is lit up there while it is on -- green while running or active, amber for a few seconds after -- and the Diagram scrolls to what has just fired.  Open Diagram builds the Diagram for the one Project everything seen so far belongs to, or for the whole configuration, whatever is selected in the main window.  Compare With What Fires When asks that feature which Profiles it says are active at the moment of the last look, and shows where the device disagrees.  It is sampling and not a feed, so a Task that runs for less than the gap between looks can be missed, and Tasker reports names, so two objects with one name light together.  Needs the interactive Diagram for the lights, and Tasker running with the HTTP Server Example project active.  Closing it stops the monitoring.  Nothing on the device is changed but the helper Task.  \n"
msgstr "- 实时监控：观察在您的 Android 设备上运行的 Profile 和 Task。 点击“开始”，Tasker 会在设备上放置一个小辅助 Task，该 Task 会多次（每几秒一次）检查 Tasker 自己的运行 Task 和活动 Profile 列表，并定期报告结果；记录哪些 Task 变为活动状态、哪些 Task 启动以及哪些 Task 结束（点击行即可跳转），并且在图表打开时，当 Task 处于活动状态时会显示绿色，活动后几秒会显示琥珀色，图表会滚动到刚刚执行的 Task。 “打开图表” 可以创建与特定项目或整个配置相关联的图表，具体取决于主窗口中选择的内容。 “与最后一次检查时的活动 Profile 比较” 功能会显示 Tasker 认为当前活动 Profile，并显示设备不一致的地方。 这是一个采样，而不是实时数据流，因此，如果 Task 的运行时间小于两次检查之间的间隔，可能会错过。 Tasker 会报告名称，因此，具有相同名称的两个对象会同时显示。 需要交互式图表来显示状态，并且 Tasker 必须与“HTTP Server 示例”项目一起运行。 关闭后，监控功能停止。 只有辅助 Task 会发生改变。\n"
msgid "- Missing Resources: Do the files, folders, images, sounds, Scenes and apps your Tasks and Profiles use still exist on your Android device?  Press Check Device and MapTasker asks the device -- it puts a small helper Task there, hands it the list of paths to test, fetches the installed apps and asks Tasker for its Scenes -- then lists what the device does not have, with every action or Profile that uses each one (click a line to go to it).  The Health Check reports the same as RESOURCE-MISSING from the last check, and says when it was made.  A path built from a variable, a wildcard and a web or content address cannot be tested and are listed as not checked; a path an action writes to is not tested, as it is not meant to exist yet; a ringtone, a Tasker icon and the images inside a Scene are not looked at.  Something is called missing only when every device you have checked lacks it.  Tasker must be running with the HTTP Server Example project active, and the device asks you to authorize the connection.  Nothing is changed on the device but the helper Task and two small files in its Tasker folder, and nothing in your configuration changes.  \n"
msgstr "- 缺失的资源：您的 Task 和 Profile 所使用的文件、文件夹、图片、声音、场景和应用程序，是否仍然存在于您的 Android 设备上？ 点击“检查设备”，Tasker 会向设备询问——它会创建一个小的辅助 Task，提供测试路径列表，获取已安装的应用程序，并询问 Tasker 的场景——然后列出设备上缺少的内容，以及使用每个内容的所有 Task 和 Profile（点击一行即可跳转）。“健康检查”报告与上次检查时“资源缺失”相同，并注明了上次检查的时间。 无法测试从变量、通配符和网络或内容地址构建的路径，这些路径会被列为未检查； 动作写入的路径不会被测试，因为这些路径尚未存在； 铃声、Tasker 图标和场景中的图像不会被检查。 只有当您检查的所有设备都缺少某个内容时，才会将其标记为“缺失”。 Tasker 必须以 HTTP Server 示例项目处于活动状态运行，并且设备会要求您授权连接。 只有辅助 Task 和 Tasker 文件夹中的两个小文件会发生变化，而您的配置不会发生任何变化。\n"
msgid "- Task Stepper: Dry-run one Task.  Pick it, say what its variables hold when it starts (Suggest Inputs lists the ones it reads before it sets them), and press Step: it walks the Task action by action and shows which If, Else If, For and Goto branches it takes, which actions it skips, and what every variable holds after each step.  Variable Set, Add, Clear and Split, and the conditions Tasker's If offers, are simulated; Flash, Notify and the like are shown with their variables filled in; anything that talks to the outside world is listed as not simulated, and a variable it may have set is unknown.  A condition that depends on a variable with no value stops the walk and names it -- or is treated as not set, true or false, as you choose -- and what an action that is not simulated leaves behind can be typed in (5: %name = value).  A Perform Task is walked into -- the called Task's actions appear indented under the call, it is given %par1 and %par2, shares the globals, and hands back its Return value (and its locals, if its Return passes them through) -- unless 'Follow Perform Task' is cleared, or the Task cannot be found, is named by a variable with no value, or is nested more than 8 deep, in which case the call is shown and its result is unknown.  Nothing runs on your phone and nothing in the configuration changes; each Task in What Fires When? has a Step button that opens it here.  \n"
msgstr "- 任务步进器：模拟执行一个任务。 选择一个任务，并说明其变量在开始时的值（“建议输入”列表列出了它读取的输入），然后点击“下一步”：它会逐步执行任务，并显示它执行的“如果”、“否则如果”、“循环”和“跳转”分支，以及它跳过的操作，以及每个变量在每个步骤后的值。 模拟了“变量设置”、“添加”、“清除”和“分割”，以及“任务器”中的“如果”条件；“闪烁”、“通知”等操作，以及它们中的变量值；任何与外部世界交互的操作都标记为未模拟，并且可能设置的变量的值未知。 如果一个依赖于没有值的变量的条件停止执行，则会显示该条件（或将其视为未设置、为真或为假），以及未模拟的操作可以输入其结果（例如： `%name = value`）。 模拟执行一个任务 – 被调用的任务的操作会显示在调用的下方，并提供 `%par1` 和 `%par2`，共享全局变量，并返回其返回值（以及如果该返回值通过它们传递，则还返回局部变量） – 除非“跟踪执行任务”被清除，或者任务无法找到，或者该任务被一个没有值的变量命名，或者嵌套深度超过 8 层，在这种情况下，会显示调用和结果未知。 你的手机上没有任何操作运行，配置中没有任何更改；“何时触发”中的每个任务都有一个“下一步”按钮，可以点击它来打开任务。\n"
msgid "- TaskerNet Updates: Link a Project, Profile, Task or Scene to the TaskerNet share it came from (paste the share's address and say which of yours it is), and MapTasker tells you when its author publishes a newer version -- when you start it, and whenever you press Check Now.  Review lists what the author changed, each with a Take this button that previews the change before anything happens and is one press of Undo afterwards.  What is taken is the author's version of that Task, Profile or Scene, except that a Profile stays as switched on or off as you had it.  Accept Latest Version takes everything listed in one go instead, with no preview of its own (one press of Undo takes it back).  Only the address of each linked share is sent to taskernet.com; nothing from your configuration leaves your computer.  An update is someone else's automation that will run on your phone, so read each preview before you take it.  Find Links searches TaskerNet's public shares for the ones your Projects, Profiles, Tasks and Scenes came from and links those whose content agrees with yours -- a name alone is not enough, as different authors reuse names; partial matches are listed for you to tick.  The scan runs in the background -- close the window and carry on -- and a notification tells you when it is done.  Stop ends the reading of TaskerNet's list early and compares yours with the part already read; Select All and Deselect All tick the whole list of possible matches.  Linked shares are also checked for a newer version automatically, without pressing Check Now: once when MapTasker starts and again each time the TaskerNet Updates window is opened, but only for a share that was last checked more than 6 hours ago.  A check is not repeated on a timer, so a MapTasker left running for days will not look again until the window is opened or Check Now is pressed.  Each linked share shows when it was last checked, and Check Now ignores the 6 hours and checks every one.  A check reads only the share's publish date, changes nothing in your configuration, and when it fails the date of the last successful check is not replaced.  \n"
msgstr "- TaskerNet 更新： 将项目、个人资料、任务或场景与 TaskerNet 分享链接关联起来（粘贴分享的地址，并说明它是您的哪个），并且 TaskerNet 会通知您作者发布了更新版本——当您启动它时，以及每次按下“检查”按钮。Review 会列出作者修改的内容，每个都有一个“撤销”按钮，可以在发生任何更改之前预览更改，然后只需单击一次即可撤销。所取的内容是作者的版本，即该任务、个人资料或场景，但个人资料的状态始终保持您设定的状态。选择“最新版本”会一次性获取所有列出的内容，但不会进行预览（单击“撤销”即可返回）。只有每个关联的分享地址才会发送到 taskernet.com；您的配置不会从您的计算机发送出去。更新是指其他人创建的自动化程序，它将在您的手机上运行，因此在您采取任何操作之前，请仔细阅读每个预览。Find Links 搜索 TaskerNet 的公共分享，以查找与您的项目、个人资料、任务和场景相关的分享，并链接内容与您匹配的分享——仅凭名称是不够的，因为不同的作者会重复使用相同的名称；系统会列出您可以选择的部分匹配项。扫描在后台运行——关闭窗口即可继续——并且会收到通知告知您扫描完成。Stop 会提前结束 TaskerNet 的读取，并将其与已读取的部分进行比较；选择“全部”和“取消选择全部”会选中所有可能的匹配项。关联的分享也会自动检查是否有更新，无需按下“检查”按钮：当 TaskerNet 更新启动时，以及每次打开 TaskerNet 更新窗口时都会进行检查，但仅针对在 6 小时前最后一次检查的分享。检查不会在定时器上重复，因此在 TaskerNet 运行数天后，只有在打开窗口或按下“检查”按钮时才会再次检查。每个关联的分享都会显示上次检查的时间，并且“检查”不会考虑 6 小时，而是对所有分享进行检查。检查只会读取分享的发布日期，不会修改您的配置，并且在失败时，不会替换上次成功的检查日期。\n"
msgid "Active Profiles"
msgstr "活跃用户"
msgid "Ask What Fires When which Profiles it says are active at the moment of the last look, and show where the device disagrees.  Only what the prediction was sure of is judged."
msgstr "询问“当设备上次查看时，哪些配置文件处于活动状态”，并显示设备与预测不一致的地方。 仅对设备确定的预测进行判断。"
msgid "Ask the device about every file, folder, image, sound, Scene and app your Tasks and Profiles use, and list the ones it does not have.  Nothing on the device is changed except the helper Task and two small files MapTasker leaves in its Tasker folder."
msgstr "询问设备关于您使用的所有文件、文件夹、图像、声音、场景和应用程序的信息，并列出设备上没有的信息。 只有 Tasker 辅助程序以及 Tasker 文件夹中 Tasker 留下的小文件，才会被改变。"
msgid "Ask the device which apps are installed right now.  Turn this off to use the list fetched earlier, which is quicker and as old as that fetch."
msgstr "询问设备当前安装的应用程序。 切换此功能，以便使用之前获取的列表，该列表更快且与之前获取的数据相同。"
msgid "Building the Diagram of"
msgstr "构建图表"
msgid "Check Device"
msgstr "检查设备"
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "正在检查..."
msgid "Compare With What Fires When"
msgstr "与什么触发火灾进行比较"
msgid "Could not start."
msgstr "无法启动。"
msgid "Device against What Fires When"
msgstr "用于防止火灾的设备"
msgid "Display with a monospaced font (e.g. Courier New) for accurate column alignment. And turn off line wrap."
msgstr "使用等宽字体（例如 Courier New），以便准确对齐列。同时，关闭换行功能。"
msgid "Do the files, folders, images, sounds, Scenes and apps your Tasks and Profiles use still exist on your Android device?  Asks the device and lists the ones it does not have, with every place that uses each.\n\nThe Health Check reports the same findings from the last time you checked."
msgstr "您的任务和个人资料使用的文件、文件夹、图片、声音、场景和应用，是否仍然存在于您的 Android 设备上？ 您的设备会列出它没有的，并标明每个使用的位置。\n\n健康检查报告会显示上次检查时相同的结果。"
msgid "Fetch the app list first"
msgstr "首先，获取应用列表。"
msgid "Follow Perform Task"
msgstr "执行任务"
msgid "Helper Task"
msgstr "辅助任务"
msgid "How long something stays marked in amber in the Diagram after it stops."
msgstr "在图表中，某个物体在停止运动后，在琥珀中保持标记的时间有多长？"
msgid "How many times the device looks at what is running during each request, a fifth of a second apart.  More looks catch shorter Tasks and make each request take longer."
msgstr "设备每次请求时，会多次检查正在运行的内容，间隔大约半秒。 频繁的检查会导致更短的任务被发现，从而延长每个请求所需的时间。"
msgid "Installing the monitor on the device..."
msgstr "在设备上安装显示器..."
msgid "Keep lit (seconds)"
msgstr "保持点燃时间（秒）"
msgid "Last checked"
msgstr "上次检查"
msgid "Light up the Diagram"
msgstr "突出图表"
msgid "Live Run Monitor"
msgstr "实时监控"
msgid "Log saved as"
msgstr "记录已保存为"
msgid "Looks per request"
msgstr "按照要求进行整理"
msgid "Missing Resources"
msgstr "缺失资源"
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"
msgid "Never checked"
msgstr "从未检查过"
msgid "Never reached in Task"
msgstr "从未完成"
msgid "No Diagram is open.  Use Open Diagram, and its Profiles and Tasks will light up."
msgstr "“No Diagram” 功能已关闭。请使用“Open Diagram”功能，其“Profile”和“任务”将显示。"
msgid "Not monitoring."
msgstr "未进行监控。"
msgid "Nothing the Tasks or Profiles use needs checking."
msgstr "不需要检查任务或个人资料中使用的任何内容。"
msgid "Open Diagram"
msgstr "开放图表"
msgid "Open the Diagram in a window of its own, to watch Profiles and Tasks light up in it.  It is built for the one Project everything seen so far belongs to, or for the whole configuration when that is more than one Project or nothing has fired yet -- whatever is selected in the main window is left as it was."
msgstr "在独立的窗口中打开图表，以便查看其中的“项目”和“任务”。 该图表专门用于显示已创建的项目，或者当有多个项目或尚未创建任何项目时，用于显示整个配置。 无论在主窗口中选择哪个项目，该项目在图表中都会保持不变。"
msgid "Running Tasks"
msgstr "执行任务"
msgid "Save Log"
msgstr "保存日志"
msgid "Save Report writes them all"
msgstr "Save Report 能够将所有内容保存下来"
msgid "Scroll the Diagram to what fires"
msgstr "滚动图表，查看“引起”的原因。"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"
msgid "Start the monitor first."
msgstr "首先启动显示器。"
msgid "Stopped."
msgstr "停止。"
msgid "The Diagram on screen has none of these to light.  Rebuild it from the loaded file, and use the interactive Diagram."
msgstr "屏幕上的图表中没有这些元素。请从加载的文件中重建它，并使用交互式图表。"
msgid "The answers could not be saved for the Health Check"
msgstr "这些答案无法保存"
msgid "The device did not answer"
msgstr "该设备没有回应。"
msgid "The device did not answer.  See the problems listed."
msgstr "该设备没有响应。请查看以下问题。"
msgid "The log could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存日志。"
msgid "There is nothing in the log yet."
msgstr "目前日志中没有任何记录。"
msgid "Waiting on the Android device -- accept the authorization prompt there if one appears.  This can take a minute."
msgstr "在 Android 设备上等待 -- 如果出现提示，请在设备上接受授权。这可能需要一分钟。"
msgid "Walk into each Task that a Perform Task calls, showing its actions indented under the call.  Turn it off to step over the calls: their results are then unknown."
msgstr "对于每个“Perform Task”调用的任务，在调用语句下方显示其操作，使其具有缩进。 关闭该任务，可以跳过其调用：此时，其结果将未知。"
msgid "Watch which Profiles and Tasks fire on your Android device as they do, and see them light up in the Diagram.\n\nCompare what the device really has active with what What Fires When predicted for the same moment.\n\nIt samples several times a second, so a Task that runs for a moment can be missed.  Nothing on the device is changed but one small helper Task."
msgstr "观察您的 Android 设备上哪些“个人资料”和“任务”在运行，并在图表中看到它们的状态。\n\n将设备实际运行的内容与“预测运行”的内容进行比较，看看在同一时间，设备上发生了什么。\n\n它每秒进行多次采样，因此，一个运行很短的任务可能会被错过。 只有辅助任务发生了变化。"
msgid "What changed"
msgstr "发生了什么变化"
msgid "Write this report to a text file in the Output Folder."
